{"4580120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sludge Department", "steam_appid": 4580120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/af821fbeece37bbfc72f4ba8b4831ce1.avif?t=1782853753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras_big/af821fbeece37bbfc72f4ba8b4831ce1.webp?t=1782853753 width=1560 height=603 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been given the task of fixing a strange water treatment plant in a remote swampy area. As an engineer, you soon discover that things are not quite right. The deeper the water gets, the stranger the people become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slosh into a point-and-click adventure where logic gets clogged in the pipes and mud mud gets on your boots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/e8981305cd92ceddee7cb69d234a31bc.poster.avif?t=1782853753\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/e8981305cd92ceddee7cb69d234a31bc.webm?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/e8981305cd92ceddee7cb69d234a31bc.mp4?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sludge Department is a point &amp; click puzzle game, with 2D as well as 3D puzzles. Through the game you will encounter mysterious and strange characters, and discover the story of the broken water treatment plant, owned by Helix Water Solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/43b65395adc0dba42c981ef70421273f.avif?t=1782853753\" width=1148 height=498 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sludge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirty water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vending machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More sludge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird things</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/1fdaf1a0fb4b851e2c578ec730b59b2c.poster.avif?t=1782853753\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/1fdaf1a0fb4b851e2c578ec730b59b2c.webm?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/1fdaf1a0fb4b851e2c578ec730b59b2c.mp4?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/8a4d0d4bdb46879ca0f38de505894b2a.webp?t=1782853753\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/8a4d0d4bdb46879ca0f38de505894b2a.poster.avif?t=1782853753\" class=\"bb_img\" width=638 height=358 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played with mouse only, but keyboard kan be used as a supplement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/ef7bb52ca9d207c4fd435d5969384bc1.avif?t=1782853753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras_big/ef7bb52ca9d207c4fd435d5969384bc1.webp?t=1782853753 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/af821fbeece37bbfc72f4ba8b4831ce1.avif?t=1782853753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras_big/af821fbeece37bbfc72f4ba8b4831ce1.webp?t=1782853753 width=1560 height=603 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been given the task of fixing a strange water treatment plant in a remote swampy area. As an engineer, you soon discover that things are not quite right. The deeper the water gets, the stranger the people become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slosh into a point-and-click adventure where logic gets clogged in the pipes and mud mud gets on your boots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/e8981305cd92ceddee7cb69d234a31bc.poster.avif?t=1782853753\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/e8981305cd92ceddee7cb69d234a31bc.webm?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/e8981305cd92ceddee7cb69d234a31bc.mp4?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sludge Department is a point &amp; click puzzle game, with 2D as well as 3D puzzles. Through the game you will encounter mysterious and strange characters, and discover the story of the broken water treatment plant, owned by Helix Water Solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/43b65395adc0dba42c981ef70421273f.avif?t=1782853753\" width=1148 height=498 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sludge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirty water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vending machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More sludge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird things</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/1fdaf1a0fb4b851e2c578ec730b59b2c.poster.avif?t=1782853753\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/1fdaf1a0fb4b851e2c578ec730b59b2c.webm?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/1fdaf1a0fb4b851e2c578ec730b59b2c.mp4?t=1782853753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580120/extras/8a4d0d4bdb46879ca0f38de505894b2a.webp?t=17